Apply the shipped operator ClusterRole and optional MCP Auth binding

Usage:
  mcp-runtime cluster operator-rbac apply [flags]

Flags:
      --context string      Explicit Kubernetes context
      --dry-run             Show changes without writing them
  -h, --help                help for apply
      --kubeconfig string   Explicit kubeconfig path
      --yes                 Apply the changes without an interactive prompt

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging
